# hw definition file for processing by chibios_pins.py
# Thunder Tiger 15in platform.
#
# The 15in uses identical flight-controller hardware to the 7in platform,
# so the entire hardware definition (including the APJ_BOARD_ID) is shared
# by including the 7in hwdef. The only difference between the two platforms
# is the default tune, which lives in this directory's defaults.parm.

include ../ThunderTiger7in/hwdef.dat
